{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：02:57 2026-07-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：02:57 2026-07-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：02:57 2026-07-15 HKT</p><p>電影《九龍城寨之終章》在廟街拍攝外景，接近凌晨2點，林峯、劉俊謙、黃德斌精神奕奕也現身廟街拍攝場地，三人到場即坐埋一齊開心對稿，準備埋位拍攝。</p><img alt=\"接近凌晨2點，林峯現身廟街。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ce5afc7a7c84acaa3c1f609761fbdb3c/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_02_02_12.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"三人到場即坐埋一齊對稿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/eae1a3594c5150bc08aadd7890bbe80a/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_02_02_13.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"爭取時間對戲中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/732bf6f057355918248be0927f4bfe4d/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_02_02_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"林峯認真Mode。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d5e8e75db9fbde043836564290905f49/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_02_02_18.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場好有氣氛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/95273652b2124a5ffd60463fed9b4147/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_02_02_19.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"型男「陳洛軍」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a6bd90d4b6f11d0838d29774b4c8584f/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_02_02_21.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"林峯好肉緊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/967cfb484c905c411cf114c20a84f810/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_02_02_22_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"林峯開心笑樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c3cd1e5ce412ae153708752a2d7c52ad/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_02_02_22.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"撳住塊面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b3c3fd4bd8411a2cf89576442f1d8f6f/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_02_02_28_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"托住個頭\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9c7b5bb160b49a0b6328661f3687aea8/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_02_02_29.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"可愛樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/830c1f2450eb81c9d8588061fe815cba/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_02_02_30.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"林峯表情多多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/224309f6d1428034ad27e407e9b8dd97/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_02_02_30_1_.jpeg\"/><p>另外，較早凌晨十二點幾時，當拍完「十二少」胡子彤衝過去混戰另一幫人的近鏡，之後拍攝另一個場口，講胡子彤一踢飛腿。有替身代為度位，當替身試位期間，起飛腿雙踢凌空飛過對面，竟然意外不小心踢中一個演員，當場受傷，一班工作人員隨即緊張衝過去照顧傷者，期間一度阻止傳媒拍攝，救護車到場送傷者入院。</p><img alt=\"胡子彤替身試位期間，起飛腿凌空飛過對面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d2ccc7b4dd2b19ca92d25b2b3c8e1529/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_00_58_06.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"竟然意外不小心踢中一個演員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/456715840de832016e6e2993f972dad7/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_00_58_07.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"一班工作人員隨即緊張衝過去照顧傷者。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e6afc2b81472d20673a70b21e2808155/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_00_58_09_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"演員受傷倒地。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/57bd7dc7a6a688367183d71014cdd18b/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_00_58_09_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工作人員顯得緊張。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e3b278f9ab98623f9498c764706a14e4/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_00_58_09.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"救護人員到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/306111ff36b5077c78d2def4092c6f69/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_00_58_10_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"將傷者送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8c41003d87ec13060fc8e6978857624f/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_00_58_10_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"拍攝出現小阻滯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e8bd031663dc0f74d828bc44c0f13a86/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_00_58_11.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"入院接受治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/779dd800ec36ee2cefa5887eba9dfb5e/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_00_58_12_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"受傷演員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/46ccfe9683b5c2945076843a3903cc78/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-15_at_00_58_13_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"情講「十二少」胡子彤一踢飛腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b3bbc42edc8e4a79f90847f101edd6f7/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-14_at_22_37_31.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-14T19:18:28.533674+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":23,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}